        <mxCell id="4seYBzSz1UIVO5nCjSV1-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#d79b00;fillColor=#ffe6cc;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;autosize=1;resizable=0;" value="Functional Requiremetns&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="160" x="100" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4seYBzSz1UIVO5nCjSV1-3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;autosize=1;resizable=0;fontColor=#333333;" value="1) user should be able to login to the e commerce platform&lt;div&gt;2) user should be able to search products&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3) user should be able to&amp;nbsp; see products images&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;4)user should be able to add products in the cart.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5)user&amp;nbsp; should be able to make payement and checkout&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="330" x="15" y="75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4seYBzSz1UIVO5nCjSV1-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#d79b00;fillColor=#ffe6cc;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;autosize=1;resizable=0;" value="Non - functional requirements&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="180" x="520" y="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4seYBzSz1UIVO5nCjSV1-5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;autosize=1;resizable=0;fontColor=#333333;" value="1) Target scale -&amp;gt;1.5 million daily active users&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;2)Availability is required more &amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt; than consistency&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3) low latency-&amp;gt; 200-300 ms&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4) scalable architecture ans it includes many micro services&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5) the system must be consistent while making the payments&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
